ecf1d355711fcf41df7c3ac53132685.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761181649","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985480/669a7c5a4ecf1d355711fcf41df7c3ac53132685/ss_669a7c5a4ecf1d355711fcf41df7c3ac53132685.600x338.jpg?t=1761181649"}],"short_description":"Nadia's Revenge is the story of Nadia, the leader of the Rebel Faction in a simulated world. She must upgrade various firearms, increase her skills, defeat enemies, and solve different types of puzzles to progress through the story and shape her own fate.","steam_appid":3985480,"support_info":{"email":"asyuram77@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America","type":"game","website":null}